                            {
                                "example_id": "c87d4e5a-cd0a-48d7-b303-63de6b5ec2f3",
                                "sense_id": "bd4e9d60-8cc2-3b1b-88ac-2838a06ebd61",
                                "text": "Akeley, Noyes hastened to inform me, was glad and ready to see me; although his sudden attack of asthma would prevent him from being a very competent host for a day or two. These spells hit him hard when they came, and were always accompanied by a debilitating fever and general weakness."
